  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large clay pot, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced chorizo and cook until it is browned.",
    "Add the chopped collard greens, berbere spice, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the clay pot to the preheated oven and roast for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the pot from the oven and stir in the lemon juice.",
    "Return the pot to the oven and roast for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Remove the pot from the oven and let it cool for a few minutes before serving."
  ],
